===== IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS =====
1. Add one application-level shell renderer.
2. Keep header and footer visible on every screen.
3. Remove carousel-owned logo, status, and footer.
4. Remove Selected Game's screen-owned Back hint.
5. Reserve the middle content area for active screens.
6. Initialize SDL_ttf before loading any fonts.
7. Shut down screens and fonts before SDL_ttf and SDL.
8. Add or update tests for shell persistence and screen-specific hints.
9. Preserve all existing user changes.

